  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "わたげの　タネは　えいようまんてん。\nかぜに　のせて　とばして　くさきや\nポケモンたちを　げんきにさせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "솜털이 붙은 씨는 영양 만점이다.\n씨를 바람에 날려서 초목과\n포켓몬들을 건강하게 만든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "棉絮的種子營養豐富。\n牠會藉由風散播種子，\n讓草木和寶可夢變得活力十足。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les graines de son duvet sont remplies\nde nutriments. Elles sont emportées par le vent\net redonnent vitalité aux plantes et aux Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Saat seines Wollflaums steckt voller\nNährstoffe. Es verstreut sie im Wind und heilt\ndamit Pflanzen und Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Las semillas que tiene entre la pelusa son muy\nnutritivas. Arrastradas por el viento, devuelven\nla vitalidad a la flora y a otros Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "I suoi semi lanuginosi, ricchi di sostanze nutritive,\nvengono trasportati dal vento e donano nuova\nenergia a piante e Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The seeds attached to its cotton fluff are full of\nnutrients. It spreads them on the wind so that\nplants and other Pokémon can benefit from them.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "綿毛の　種は　栄養満点。\n風に　乗せて　飛ばして　草木や\nポケモンたちを　元気にさせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "棉絮的种子营养丰富。\n它会通过风散播种子，\n让草木和宝可梦变得活力十足。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Las semillas que tiene entre la pelusa son muy\nnutritivas. Arrastradas por el viento, devuelven\nla vitalidad a la flora y a otros Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまの　わたげで　つくった　いとは\nこうたくがあり　とても　うつくしい。\nガラルちほうの　めいさんひん。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리의 솜털로 만든 실은\n윤이 나고 매우 아름답다.\n가라르지방의 특산품이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用牠頭上的棉絮製成的線\n有著十分美麗動人的光澤，\n是伽勒爾地區的名產。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les fils tissés à partir du duvet sur sa tête sont\nsatinés et absolument somptueux. Le textile ainsi\ncréé est typique de la région de Galar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aus dem Flaum auf seinem Kopf werden\nwunderschöne, glänzende Fäden gesponnen.\nDie Galar-Region ist bekannt für dieses Produkt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El hilo fabricado a partir de su algodón es muy\nbello y brillante; uno de los productos estrella\nde la región de Galar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "I fili realizzati con la lanugine del suo capo sono\nparticolarmente belli e lucenti. Sono un prodotto\ntipico di Galar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The cotton on the head of this Pokémon can be\nspun into a glossy, gorgeous yarn—a Galar\nregional specialty.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭の　綿毛で　つくった　糸は\n光沢があり　とても　美しい。\nガラル地方の　名産品。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用它头上的棉絮制成的线\n有着十分美丽动人的光泽，\n是伽勒尔地区的名产。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El hilo fabricado a partir de su algodón es muy\nbello y brillante; uno de los productos estrella\nde la región de Galar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    }
